+### Native-mode grayscale batching
+
+`ImageBatch.Grayscale()` applies `ImageOps.grayscale` in submission order. GPU
+groups reuse the existing grayscale pipeline for same-size `L`, `LA`, `RGB`,
+`RGBA`, and `YCbCr` inputs. YCbCr stays packed as three-byte YCbCr data and
+grayscale copies its Y sample; the batch path does not route it through RGB or
+RGBA conversion. CPU and SIMD queues use the normal per-image grayscale route,
+and `queue=False` continues to execute immediately. Ordinary
+`ImageOps.grayscale` routing is unchanged.
+
