+metadata, source immutability, submission order, CPU/SIMD results, and one real
+GPU dispatch per compatible mode group against Pillow 12.2.0. The focused
+target-only fault-contract lane, documented in the [command reference](COMMANDS.md),
+injects a dimension failure and an allocation failure into the grouped YCbCr
+GPU path. Each case verifies per-image GPU fallback against the Pillow output,
+preserves inputs and order, and confirms that the executor accepts a subsequent
+job. These injected failures are separate from ordinary oracle parity because
+Pillow cannot reproduce an internal GPU group failure.
