+each window included image construction, submission, execution, and output
+materialization. The GPU formed one dispatch, but this first full-call result
+does not meet the throughput target:
+
+| Backend | Median window (ms) | Pixel throughput (Mpx/s) |
+| --- | ---: | ---: |
+| Pillow 12.2.0, sequential | 12.727 | 989 |
+| Serial CPU, queued per-image | 14.406 | 873 |
+| SIMD, queued per-image | 11.731 | 1,073 |
+| GPU, queued native-mode group | 21.918 | 574 |
+
